  },
  "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice.": {
   "comment": "Live-mask deletion alert: informative text explaining the Bake vs. Remove Links choice.",
   "extractionState": "manual",
   "localizations": {
    "zh-Hans": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "「烘焙」会将当前蒙版效果保留到依赖图层的像素中;「断开链接」会显示依赖图层的全部像素。两种选择都可以撤销。"
     }
    }
   }
  },
